{"product_id":"bee-boy-clash-of-the-killer-queens","title":"Bee Boy: Clash of the Killer Queens","description":"\u003cp\u003eHalf BEE. Half BOY. Melvin Meadly is . . . BEE BOY. As a bee, Mel is ready to defend his hive against all enemies - taking on killer wasps, terrifying hawkmoths, and battling queen bees. But as a boy, has he got what it takes to protect his bees (and himself) against the greatest menace of all Nasty Norman Crudwell? The highly entertaining story of an unlikely superhero, full of fantastic facts, and illustrated in black and yellow!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 187\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: De Saulles Tony\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780192763877\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 173\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803730108569,"sku":"15RB-3-9780192763877","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f363244993b_Bee_Boy-_Clash_of_the_Killer_Queens_De_Saulles_Tony.jpg?v=1760808197","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/bee-boy-clash-of-the-killer-queens","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}